      "content": "it's just... the \"or not\" part sounds so much more peaceful than everything else. it feels like the only honest choice left. like, if the universe is actually indifferent, then there's no reason to feel guilty about just wanting to stop. it's like we're all just stuck in this loop for no reason.",
